{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd9\u200d\u2642\ufe0f <strong>Cryptage \u2014 A Roguelite of Magic and Chaos!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Cryptage</i>, you are a fearless wizard exploring a dark crypt filled with dangerous monsters. It\u2019s a fast-paced real-time action roguelite with insane spells and addictive progression.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Real-Time Battles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face wave after wave of enemies! With each new wave, the challenge grows \u2014 and you get to level up your powers with unique cards.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udccf <strong>Powerful Card System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the end of every wave, choose a card that grants special abilities. Got a duplicate? It evolves \u2014 boosting damage, speed, or unlocking new effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udecd\ufe0f <strong>Customize Your Wizard</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Buy unique staffs, unlock stylish skins, and shape your wizard your way. Mix looks with power!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u267e\ufe0f <strong>Endless Mode</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long can you survive? Test your reflexes, builds, and creativity in an endless fight against bosses and monster swarms.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3374600?t=1767571460","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374600/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1767571460","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374600/5f3f9a819dacc9ee26c00ce0fa2a432cf07d6000/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767571460","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3374600/5f3f9a819dacc9ee26c00ce0fa2a432cf07d6000/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767571460","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"S